{"availability":"available","full":"aws-samples/sagemaker-ssh-helper","name":"sagemaker-ssh-helper","description":"A helper library to connect into Amazon SageMaker with AWS Systems Manager and SSH (Secure Shell)","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":261,"forks":34,"created":"2022-10-14T17:56:45Z","updated":"2025-07-07T15:48:59Z","license":"MIT-0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["amazon-sagemaker","aws","aws-systems-manager","machine-learning","pycharm","sagemaker","sagemaker-studio","ssh","vscode"],"demo":"https://aws-blogs-artifacts-public.s3.amazonaws.com/artifacts/ML-4988/SSH_Helper-Shell-To-Training-Jobs.mov","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:08.550Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:08.550Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:08.550Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T13:35:08.550Z","stars":261,"forks":34}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SageMaker SSH Helper is the \"army-knife\" library that helps you to securely connect to Amazon SageMaker training jobs, processing jobs, batch inference jobs and realtime inference endpoints as well as SageMaker Studio set of IDEs and SageMaker Notebook Instances for fast interactive experimentation, remote debugging, and advanced troubleshooting.","Three most common tasks that motivated to create the library, sometimes referred as \"SSH into SageMaker\", are:","like nvidia-smi and neuron-ls, or iteratively fix and re-execute your training script within seconds."],"features":["A terminal session into a container running in SageMaker to diagnose a stuck training job, use CLI commands","Remote debugging of a code running in SageMaker from your local favorite IDE like","Port forwarding to access auxiliary tools running inside SageMaker, e.g., Dask dashboard, Streamlit apps, TensorBoard or Spark Web UI.","Connecting to SageMaker training jobs with SSM - shell access only, open a shell to a single- or multi-node training job to e